# Run output and the page cache, never source. The package was renamed from
# lotcomps to recomps and these rules were not, so a live run's cached pages
# under src/recomps/markets/*/data/http-cache/ matched nothing and would have
# been committed. Only the CI privacy job stood between that and a push.
src/recomps/markets/*/data/
